    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "The petitioner -- Sanjeev Kumar has filed the instant petition under Section 438 Cr.P.C. for grant of anticipatory bail in FIR No.369 dated 16.09.2021 under Sections 376 (2) (N), 328 and 506 registered at Police Station City Jagadhri, District Yamuna Nagar.",
