      "summary_sent_score": 0.21634919941425323
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "The facts of the case are that the prosecutrix gave her statement to the police that she was living separate from her husband for the last 6-7 years.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 773,
      "end": 923,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2411680966615677
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "She is the mother of a son and a daughter.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 924,
      "end": 966,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2562207877635956
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "The daughter is staying with her, studying at Rohtak and her son is staying with his father.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 967,
      "end": 1059,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Rohtak",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1013,
          "end": 1019
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23117376863956451
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "About 9-10 months ago she started working at the shop of Sanjeev.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1060,
      "end": 1125,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sanjeev",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1117,
          "end": 1124
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2527858316898346
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "He took her to Yamuna Nagar and gave her cold drink laced with some intoxicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1126,
      "end": 1205,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24985827505588531
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "He took her to his sister's house by saying that there was some work to be done.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1206,
      "end": 1286,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24167068302631378
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "She regained her senses after 2-3 hours and she was brought back to her house.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1287,
      "end": 1365,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24756312370300293
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "After 2-3 days, Sanjeev started blackmailing her by showing SANDEEP CRM-M-44872-2021 (O&M) -2- her MMS video, wherein he had committed rape with her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1366,
      "end": 1515,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sanjeev",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1382,
          "end": 1389
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26937898993492126
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "She left the jobs.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1516,
      "end": 1534,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.34650513529777527
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "She was blackmailed and forced her to join and raped number of times.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1535,
      "end": 1604,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.34175345301628113
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "Ultimately the matter was reported to the police.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1605,
      "end": 1654,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2714044451713562
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the petitioner argued that he is falsely implicated in this case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1655,
      "end": 1741,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22702236473560333
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "At the most it can be a consensual relationship.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1742,
      "end": 1790,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2621060907840729
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "The prosecutrix is in a habit of leveling such like allegations.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1791,
      "end": 1855,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27403679490089417
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "Earlier she got registered such like cases against her brother-in-law Surender Kumar Bansal who was acquitted for the offence under Section 376 and 506 IPC.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1856,
      "end": 2012,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Surender Kumar Bansal",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1926,
          "end": 1947
        },
        {
          "text": "Section 376",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1988,
          "end": 1999
        },
        {
          "text": "506",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2004,
          "end": 2007
        },
        {
          "text": "IPC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2008,
          "end": 2011
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28670573234558105
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "Copy of judgment of acquittal dated 24.04.2018 is Annexure P-2.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2013,
      "end": 2076,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "24.04.2018",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2049,
          "end": 2059
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.06251874566078186
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "She got registered another FIR No.429 dated 26.10.2021 under Section 506 and 511 Police Station City Jagadhri in which cancellation report was filed and the petitioner had filed protest petition.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2077,
      "end": 2272,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "26.10.2021",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2121,
          "end": 2131
        },
        {
          "text": "Section 506",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2138,
          "end": 2149
        },
        {
          "text": "511",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2154,
          "end": 2157
        },
        {
          "text": "Police Station City Jagadhri",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2158,
          "end": 2186
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2512345314025879
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "It is argued that he was granted the relief of ad-interim bail and fully Sanjeev Kumar vs State Of Haryana on 20 January, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/199067452/\n1 participated in the investigation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2273,
      "end": 2491,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sanjeev Kumar vs State Of Haryana",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 2346,
          "end": 2379
        },
        {
          "text": "20 January, 2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2383,
          "end": 2399
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3472626805305481
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "The mobile phone in his possession were also handed over to the police.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2492,
      "end": 2563,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3090474605560303
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "He is still ready to cooperate in the investigation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2564,
      "end": 2616,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2556765079498291
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "The allegations are false.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2617,
      "end": 2643,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2396746277809143
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "It is prayed that his ad-interim bail already granted may be confirmed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2644,
      "end": 2715,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16056442260742188
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "The bail application is opposed by counsel for the complainant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2716,
      "end": 2780,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2596304416656494
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "It is argued that the allegations are specific and serious in nature.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2781,
      "end": 2850,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19951385259628296
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "She was threatened and blackmailed and was repeatedly raped.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2851,
      "end": 2911,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3663518726825714
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "Considering the gravity of offence, he is not entitled to be released on bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2912,
      "end": 2991,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23308826982975006
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 38,
      "text": "The status report is filed by counsel representing the State where it is conceded that the petitioner had joined the investigation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2992,
      "end": 3124,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2236122488975525
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 39,
      "text": "The recovery memo regarding the mobile phone dated 01.11.2021 is placed on record along with the police zimnis.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3125,
      "end": 3236,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "01.11.2021",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3176,
          "end": 3186
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.08627625554800034
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 40,
      "text": "However, considering the gravity of offence the anticipatory bail application filed by the petitioner may be I have considered the arguments and have gone through the SANDEEP CRM-M-44872-2021 (O&M) -3- record.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3237,
      "end": 3446,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15882308781147003
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 41,
      "text": "The facts of the case indicate that the alleged occurrence took place about 9/10 months ago from the registration of FIR.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3447,
      "end": 3568,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3306514322757721
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 42,
      "text": "She has referred incidents of rape.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3569,
      "end": 3605,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.36472833156585693
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 43,
      "text": "However, the FIR was registered after a long gap.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3606,
      "end": 3655,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3410947322845459
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 44,
      "text": "The petitioner is a mature lady, mother of two grown up children.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3656,
      "end": 3721,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3647662401199341
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 45,
      "text": "On the other hand, the petitioner was her employer.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3722,
      "end": 3773,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.37887290120124817
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 46,
      "text": "He has placed on record copy of another judgment with such like offence in which the accused was acquitted.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3774,
      "end": 3881,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3496391475200653
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 47,
      "text": "It cannot be ignored that after the grant of ad-interim bail vide order dated 28.10.2021 the petitioner joined the investigation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3882,
      "end": 4011,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "28.10.2021",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3960,
          "end": 3970
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.40555810928344727
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 48,
      "text": "He handed over his three mobile phone to the police which are subject matter of investigation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 4012,
      "end": 4106,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3976583778858185
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 49,
      "text": "The petitioner is still ready to join the investigation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 4107,
      "end": 4163,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.43184134364128113
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 50,
      "text": "Considering his conduct and the aforesaid facts the ad-interim bail already granted vide order dated 28.10.2021 stands confirmed subject to the same terms and conditions as provided under Section 438(2) Cr.P.C.\nThe petition is, accordingly, disposed of.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
